---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

export async function getStaticPaths() {
  return [{ params: { lang: undefined } }];
}
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy and data protection guidelines for our B2B insulation materials platform.">
  <section class="border-b border-gray-200 bg-[#f8f9fa] py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 text-center">
      <h1
        class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#0f172a] md:text-5xl">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">
        Effective Date: June 5, 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6">
      <div
        class="prose prose-lg prose-headings:text-[#0f172a] prose-headings:font-bold prose-a:text-[#2563eb] hover:prose-a:text-[#1d4ed8] max-w-none text-gray-600">
        <p>
          Welcome to our website. We are committed to protecting the privacy and
          security of our B2B partners, independent distributors, and website
          visitors. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and
          safeguard your personal information when you visit our website or
          submit inquiries regarding our premium insulation materials, including <strong>
            Glass Wool Blankets
          </strong> and <strong>Rubber Plastic Pipes</strong>.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          When you interact with our website, request a wholesale quote, or fill
          out our contact forms, we may collect the following types of
          information:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Personal Identification Information:</strong> Full name, email
            address, phone number, and company name.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Inquiry Details:</strong> Specific project requirements, shipping
            destinations, and volume estimates for insulation materials.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Technical Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, operating system,
            and browsing behavior on our site (collected automatically via cookies).
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell your personal data. We use the information we collect
          strictly for professional B2B purposes, including:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            To respond to your inquiries and provide accurate pricing for Glass
            Wool and Rubber Plastic Pipe products.
          </li>
          <li>
            To process custom OEM requests and manage global shipping logistics.
          </li>
          <li>
            To send you important administrative messages, order updates, and
            technical support documentation.
          </li>
          <li>
            To improve our website's user experience and analyze product demand
            trends.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
        <p>
          We respect your business confidentiality. We may share your
          information only with trusted third-party service providers who assist
          us in operating our business, such as:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Freight Forwarders & Logistics Partners:</strong> To calculate
            shipping costs and arrange delivery to your designated port or warehouse.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>IT & Hosting Providers:</strong> To securely host our website
            and manage our inquiry database.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          These third parties are contractually obligated to keep your
          information confidential and use it only for the services they provide
          to us.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your
          personal and company information from unauthorized access, alteration,
          disclosure, or destruction. All data submitted through our contact
          forms is encrypted using SSL (Secure Socket Layer) technology.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
        <p>
          Our website uses "cookies" to enhance your browsing experience.
          Cookies are small files placed on your device that help us analyze web
          traffic and remember your preferences. You can choose to accept or
          decline cookies through your browser settings, though declining may
          limit some functionalities of our site.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Your Data Protection Rights</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on your location (such as the GDPR for European clients),
          you may have the following rights regarding your personal data:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            The right to access, update, or delete the information we have on
            you.
          </li>
          <li>
            The right to restrict or object to our processing of your personal
            data.
          </li>
          <li>
            The right to request a copy of your personal data in a structured,
            machine-readable format.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise any of these rights, please contact us using the
          information provided below.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update our Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in
          our business practices or legal requirements. We will notify you of
          any significant changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page
          and updating the "Effective Date."
        </p>

        <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our
          data practices, please contact our support team:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> jinlimei@kingsendainsulation.com</li>
          <li>
            <strong>Address:</strong> Bao'an District, Shenzhen, Guangdong, China
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
